  "title": "A mini media player for podcasts, audio, and video",
  "summary": "<p>A lot of the sites I subscribe to have audio and video embedded directly in the stories. Podcasts, YouTube channels, news clips. But playing them in NewsBlur has always been a bit awkward: you hit play on the native browser control, then if you scroll to the next story or switch feeds, the audio just stops. I wanted something that keeps playing while you keep reading.</p> So I built a persistent mini media player. It sits at the bottom of your screen and handles audio, video, and YouTube f...",
